# Everything here is REBUILDABLE. None of it should ever be transferred
# between machines or committed - SETUP.md regenerates all of it.

# The virtual environment bakes in absolute paths, so it cannot be copied to
# another machine even if you wanted to. Always recreate it.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The database: ~7 GB, rebuilt from data/raw by graph/build.py
data/*.duckdb
data/*.duckdb.wal
data/tmp/

# The downloaded archives: ~2 GB, re-fetched by ingest/fetch.py
data/raw/

# Downloaded SRE prose for the search layer
corpus/

# The embedding model file, vendored at build time
models/

# Secrets. The model API key lives here and must never leave the machine.
.env
*.key

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
